  "limitations": [
    "UCC model is original UCC27524, not guaranteed UCC27524A/SOIC corners.",
    "MOSFET models are typical, fixed temperature, no self heating or guaranteed maximum charge. DMP Rta numerical floor changed from1e-20 to1e-6ohm; original source retained.",
    "Rail waveforms, 0.5ohm/10uH motor and 100nH gate/5nH source L are explicit assumptions.",
    "Generic flyback diode, ideal prescribed battery sources, no measured wiring parasitics. battery_loss is a forced battery voltage collapse, not an open-disconnect test.",
    "Threshold overlap uses minimum data sheet thresholds at low test current, not a direct shoot-through current.",
    "Cross-current indicator includes displacement/diode currents, not solely channel conduction.",
    "UCC macro uses ideal internal supplies, so zero-VDD physical behavior is not proven.",
    "4.7ohm external resistors are a circuit proposal, not present in canonical or prior candidate CAD."
